message: "If you use or refer to this software, please cite it as below."
title: "iREPORT: civic problem reporting for Mumbai"
abstract: >-
  A web application for reporting civic problems in Mumbai. Citizens report potholes, garbage, broken streetlights,
  water leaks and electrical hazards with photos and a map pin; ward officers work from a control room that ranks
  complaints by risk (impact x likelihood) and tracks every action until the citizen confirms the fix.
type: software
